<title>SRI LANKA: TABLE-S.Lanka benchmark 12-month T-bills unchanged.</title>
<headline>TABLE-S.Lanka benchmark 12-month T-bills unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of 12-month treasury bills remained unchanged, while three and six-month yields rose by 0.02 percentage points each at Wednesday's auction, the Central Bank said. The Central Bank also said it bought bills worth 118 million rupees.</p>
<p>		   Bids received   Bids accepted   Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     2,596	     1,875	  11.06 (11.04)</p>
<p>    6 months	 745		 370	  11.89 (11.87)</p>
<p>    12 months	451		 336	  12.73 (12.73)</p>
<p>    Total	  3,792		2,581</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
